----

## What we heard

In the discussions, people proposed a wide range of policy ideas about AI's impact on work and the economy. We grouped these into 27 distinct ideas. Then we ranked them according to:

- How often an idea came up across discussions (frequency), and
- How much support it drew when it did (how often it was a popular idea).

That ranking sorts the concepts into three tiers:

