**How to read these tiers**

The ranking shows how an idea fared across discussions. It's not a verdict on its merit. An idea in the "Some support" tier may still matter a great deal to many people.

These are the ideas participants voiced. They are separate from what current policy or legislation may already do. Some may align with items already moving through the policy landscape.

